    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "How to read this dashboard",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "This dashboard covers one pattern: **a long-running Activity that heartbeats a progress checkpoint\nand resumes from it instead of restarting at item 0.**\n\n* **Resumed attempt share** is the pattern firing. Under chaos it should be the majority of attempts.\n* **Resume offset** is what the pattern buys you: the item index a retry started from. Offset 0 means\n  a retry threw away all its progress.\n* **Reprocessing overhead** is what the pattern costs you. The SDK throttles heartbeats to ~80% of\n  the heartbeat timeout, so the last few items before a crash are always redone. That is why the\n  Activity has to be idempotent.\n* **Heartbeat throttle ratio** is `Heartbeat()` calls per actual `RecordActivityTaskHeartbeat` RPC.\n  The Activity calls it once per item; the SDK collapses those into far fewer RPCs.\n\n**The drill:** `docker compose restart worker`, then watch *fresh vs resumed attempts* and\n*resume offset*. Attempts should come back as `resumed=true` with a non-zero offset."
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "id": 1,
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Pattern health",
      "id": 2,
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Resumed attempt share",
      "description": "Share of Activity attempts that picked up from a checkpoint instead of item 0.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "prometheus"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(heartbeat_demo_activity_attempt_started{resumed=\"true\"}[$__rate_interval])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(heartbeat_demo_activity_attempt_started[$__rate_interval])), 0.0001)",
          "instant": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "auto",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "orientation": "auto"
      },
      "id": 3,
